  "slug": "egg-white-veggie-breakfast-scramble",
  "name": "Egg white and vegetable scramble",
  "description": "A lean, high-protein scramble: egg whites set in soft curds around diced potato, spinach, bell pepper and onion, with just enough olive oil to brown the potato.",
  "iconKey": "crosshair",
  "instructions": [
    "Dice the potato small, then cook it in a wide nonstick skillet with the olive oil over medium heat until tender and browned at the edges, about 7 minutes.",
    "Add the onion and bell pepper and cook until they soften, about 3 minutes.",
    "Pour in the egg white, season with the salt and black pepper, and stir slowly until it sets into soft curds.",
    "Fold in the spinach, cook just until it wilts, then divide between two warm plates."
